    {
      "id": "SD-01",
      "boundary": "StartRun and runtime tool metadata",
      "currentMain": "StartRun adds optional requestContext: RequestContextV1. Main Service constructs its runtime input without programTools.",
      "reviewedM12": "StartRun adds optional programTools metadata. Service selects it for the main thread and supplies it to runtime adapters. Pi consumes input.programTools; Official forwards snapshot.programTools into createHostTools.",
      "impact": "The shared interface and Service construction require both extensions to be preserved. Selecting either conflicting declaration wholesale drops the other field. Taking main Service input construction unchanged with the reviewed M12 adapters omits their program metadata.",
