      "id": "SD-02",
      "boundary": "Prepared request admission and one-input ownership",
      "currentMain": "Service adds prepareRequestContext/getRequestPreparation, Outbox.requestContextId, preparation and exact claim checks at message admission and input.processing. With context.compilerV1 enabled, deliverInputs selects eligible.slice(0,1). RequestContextCustody.finalize rejects input.inputIds?.length !== 1.",
