    {
      "id": "SD-03",
      "boundary": "Asynchronous custody immediately before Runtime.start/followUp",
      "currentMain": "Service awaits requestCustody.finalize, calls assertFinalized, rechecks run/account binding, dispatches, and releases custody. Finalization freezes a cloned input, awaits a host hook, validates current ownership/source, records HOST_PREPARED metadata, and checks again after synchronous Store observers.",
      "reviewedM12": "Service constructs programTools and directly dispatches after its existing run/account assertions, without this custody boundary.",
      "impact": "Combined tool selection, owner/grant checks and cancellation across the new asynchronous boundary are unverified by the accepted M12 source cut.",
      "qualification": "The finalizer returns freezeRequestValue({ ...input, prompt, requestContext: receipt }). It preserves supplied input fields by spreading input. This audit does not claim inherent loss of programTools by the finalizer.",
