    {
      "id": "SD-04",
      "boundary": "Request metadata identity versus M12 disclosure authority",
      "currentMain": "RequestContextV1 is explicitly observed metadata, not a grant or native transcript. Its public owner is threadId/workspaceId, with separate model/account binding and contextGeneration. Service requestBasis also validates physical profile/project/workspace identities, current grants, source content and private admission state. Its toolRegistryDigest is digest(buildToolRegistry()).",
      "reviewedM12": "M12 keeps separate six-field run ownership and selected-definition disclosure commitments. ToolDisclosure.snapshot computes digest(definitions) for the selected complete RegistryEntry definitions.",
      "impact": "The new M04 request metadata is not an interchangeable replacement for the locally reviewed M12 disclosure/result prerequisite subset. Its registry commitment does not itself prove the exact M12 selected tool set or lifecycle composition.",
